      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1xk0oad'
    '|a||So responders pay to punish low offers. That leaves the proposers: are they being fair, or just careful?':
