      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:ydmijq'
    '|a||That''s the dictator game. In 1994 Robert Forsythe and colleagues ran it side by side with the ultimatum game.':
