      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:gvqqnt'
    '|a||Across many ultimatum studies, the average offer is about forty percent.':
