      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1tz13n5'
    '|b||Your guess: with no veto at all, what share do dictators hand over on average? Drag the dictator bar to the share you think dictators give.':
