      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:ne1kf3'
    '|a||About twenty-eight percent, averaged over more than a hundred experiments. Many give nothing, but most give something.':
