      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1bx7f4t'
    '|b||And the twenty-eight that''s left is what people give when nobody can punish them. That''s closer to fairness.':
