      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:ac36eb'
    '|b||An earlier drawcast, "You have $100 to split with a stranger", puts it in a line: we offer what we expect to be accepted. True, but only half the story.':
