      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:oz2m7i'
    '|a||The cleaner fairness signal is the responder: a refusal costs real money and buys nothing but the point.':
